# The in-tree PEP 517 backend (`build-backend = "_build"`, `backend-path = ["."]`
# in pyproject.toml). setuptools' sdist does not include it by default, and an
# sdist without its own backend cannot be built at all — pip stops at
# `BackendUnavailable: Cannot find module '_build'` before reading anything
# else. Verified by building the sdist and installing from it.
include _build.py
